# Productivity Sidekick — Cloudflare Pages redirects file
#
# PR-1.5b: removed the previous "/*  /index.html  200" SPA fallback rule.
# Cloudflare flagged it as an infinite loop on every deploy, and Pages
# already serves index.html for / by default. The app uses local React
# state for view routing — no client-side router, no deep links — so SPA
# fallback was unnecessary.
#
# This file is intentionally left in place (rather than deleted) to make
# it obvious WHERE Pages redirect rules go if we ever need them.
